    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31515" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴσ-πραξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>getting in</i> or <i>collection</i> of taxes or dues, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦθύματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					5.53
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν εἰσφορῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					24.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				364
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				50
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Ephesus</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1273.24
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρύνεσθαι.. ἀδίκοις εἰσπράξεσι</span>”
				<i>exactions, OG</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					1669.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Demetr.</u>
				27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
